# Shadowgale Squirrel from Vayn Moongaze on Zephras Isle, for Revered with the
# Nightclaw Druids.
# Sources: NPC 254151 (position, seen there in the beta); Forever's client data
# (ItemSparse 280347: 50s, Nightclaw Druids Revered, binds when picked up).
# The Nightclaw Druids reputation comes from the Shadowgale storyline and the
# ear turn-ins: the Nightclaw Druids Reputation guide has the numbers.
# INGAME: can a character who is not Skyborne ride the skyboat to Zephras Isle
# and earn Nightclaw standing? (Two beta reports say anyone may visit; one
# says only Skyborne.)

step Skyboat from Dalaran
  only Alliance
  when !zone "Zephras Isle"
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting island; by beta reports anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the north side of Dalaran about every five minutes (another flies from north of Thunder Bluff; either faction may take either).
  goto 12.5,51.8 "Skyboat to Zephras Isle" live

step Skyboat from Thunder Bluff
  only Horde
  when !zone "Zephras Isle"
  zone Mulgore
  tip Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting island; by beta reports anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff, about every five minutes (another flies from Dalaran; either faction may take either).
  goto 34.3,25.8 "Skyboat to Zephras Isle" live

step Revered with the Nightclaw Druids
  zone map 2521
  tip Vayn Moongaze, the druids' quartermaster, waits inside their den in the Shadowgale Forest, the cave just north-east of Elegael Thornpaw's camp. He sells the squirrel (50s) once you are Revered with the Nightclaw Druids. Get there young: the Shadowgale storyline and Vayn's first ear quest take you to Friendly, and his repeatable pays 1000 for five Al'Aketh Cultist's Ears up to level 18 but, by Classic's rules, only 200 from level 22. From Friendly to Revered that is about 80 ears at level 18 and about 400 at 22 or above. The Nightclaw Druids Reputation guide walks you through it.
  rep 2758 "Nightclaw Druids" Revered
  vendor 254151 "Vayn Moongaze" @63.8,36
  buy 280347 "Shadowgale Squirrel" npc 254151 @63.8,36 -- 50s
